o i just wanted to mention that im a huge vocaloid fan and i saw that you're a big len fan! amazing choice! I did see your artwork and i was really captivated by your art style! it made me want to get one of my OC Lulu megurine (inspired by Luka megurine) and my friend koto! we have this inside joke that we both really love In n out (a popular burger spot here in the west) And i wanted a drawing of both our characters eating in a wrapper that's similar to theirs! My idea was to have Lulu sleeping with a wrapper hanging while koto was eating a burger in that similar wrapper! i hope thats okay! thank you so much for your consideration and its much appreciated! \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EM7_Q9ObboTH0QfYoAV1ASvErcUkuA1k?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EM7_Q9ObboTH0QfYoAV1ASvErcUkuA1k?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Len_02_1227/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fbc63fb/uploads/origins/7edddcbd-10be-4deb-bfbf-02b0d3f282d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e090043b2cd2b3d2852b0c84a313e42c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fbc63fb/uploads/origins/7edddcbd-10be-4deb-bfbf-02b0d3f282d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e090043b2cd2b3d2852b0c84a313e42c, https://si.imgix.net/9fbc63fb/uploads/origins/7edddcbd-10be-4deb-bfbf-02b0d3f282d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ab38f229b10272dad393bb8782329fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fbc63fb/uploads/origins/7edddcbd-10be-4deb-bfbf-02b0d3f282d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e43fd80f87a47cd683825f7b31de2e30 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "二人の作品を描く必要があり、kaitoは対応する色の帽子をかぶることができます。作品の色系はkaitoの主要な色系を中心に据えています。その他の内容や構図は自由に発揮できます！\n\nhttps://x.com/_khykh/status/2018550840521523239?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Len_02_1227/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/09ad126e/uploads/origins/0a92ce0e-112a-4eb6-970b-c81eabc580c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90a17c07fc4e78f8915a19d2e4affd1b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09ad126e/uploads/origins/0a92ce0e-112a-4eb6-970b-c81eabc580c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90a17c07fc4e78f8915a19d2e4affd1b, https://si.imgix.net/09ad126e/uploads/origins/0a92ce0e-112a-4eb6-970b-c81eabc580c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cedc71caf1ed9ae711b4f922c8857ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09ad126e/uploads/origins/0a92ce0e-112a-4eb6-970b-c81eabc580c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b62cb336b662d325fdbffa7e053ca89c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "シチュエーションは一緒にチョコレートを作ることで、動作は二人が同じチョコレートを噛みながら互いに見つめ合い、コウジがヒロの顎を支えます。ヒロは情熱的で恥ずかしがり屋で驚き、コウジは優しく誘惑的です。曖昧な雰囲気に重点を置きたいです～みりあさん、お疲れ様です！\n\nhttps://x.com/_khykh/status/1993719807951434088?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Len_02_1227/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d5d51ce/uploads/origins/7e4b2285-34f1-481b-b4dc-751e81fbc15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c08a4b53fb1bf6d8eaaec5ffbc381ad0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d5d51ce/uploads/origins/7e4b2285-34f1-481b-b4dc-751e81fbc15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c08a4b53fb1bf6d8eaaec5ffbc381ad0, https://si.imgix.net/1d5d51ce/uploads/origins/7e4b2285-34f1-481b-b4dc-751e81fbc15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6daa78f7f17d6e5ecb9f7cb7ed78b3a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d5d51ce/uploads/origins/7e4b2285-34f1-481b-b4dc-751e81fbc15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=890ba8a41735b0f9fe3868ca73c9354e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "構図は、私のキャラクターの顎がkaitoの頭に重なって、私のキャラクターの手が彼の首を抱きしめて、表情は嬉しくて興奮してkaitoを見ていることを望んでいます。Kaitoは下にクリスマスプレゼントを持って、少し頭を上げて嬉しそうに私を見ている。簡単な背景が欲しいならOK！\n\nhttps://x.com/_khykh/status/1951597057023811618?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Len_02_1227/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/403d49b9/uploads/origins/a96ed263-3a3e-4682-a8a4-eb935674674a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fb284b65182e9a8910f27a39f3e51f3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/403d49b9/uploads/origins/a96ed263-3a3e-4682-a8a4-eb935674674a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fb284b65182e9a8910f27a39f3e51f3, https://si.imgix.net/403d49b9/uploads/origins/a96ed263-3a3e-4682-a8a4-eb935674674a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38301d6064229e0c7bc597910e5f7713 2x, https://si.imgix.net/403d49b9/uploads/origins/a96ed263-3a3e-4682-a8a4-eb935674674a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=108cec2cb809de521af77666b2745f88 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好这边是打算申请的动作是kouji公主抱hiro他们两个头互相贴着温馨的笑起来～半身插画，然后抱着生日蛋糕，非常感谢\n\nhttps://x.com/zuxi_tx/status/1971587265123307727?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Len_02_1227/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0de732e/uploads/origins/217cd1a9-34f0-4d6c-bacd-e210ae7a54fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08b2d4f1d169adeea316d3c0284898c4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0de732e/uploads/origins/217cd1a9-34f0-4d6c-bacd-e210ae7a54fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08b2d4f1d169adeea316d3c0284898c4, https://si.imgix.net/a0de732e/uploads/origins/217cd1a9-34f0-4d6c-bacd-e210ae7a54fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c04787ed7650fcb29166f1321711df2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0de732e/uploads/origins/217cd1a9-34f0-4d6c-bacd-e210ae7a54fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c4e40a99ff5d78cba155be39470dc9c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたが有償で絵を描くことができて嬉しいです！紫色の髪の女の子が描かれています。誕生日なので、誕生日ケーキと誕生日キャップがあればいいのですが、アクションはomakaseできますか？希望の表情が明るいです～カイトのような要素があればいいのですが キャラクタマップ上の青い髪の女の子の要素もあります(´▽｀)\n\nhttps://lurl.cc/1142q", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}